OL,3,GNEWSANew lease of life for troubled
OL,4,Aracecourse
OL,5,
OL,6,FHorse racing could return to Essex
OL,7,Fafter a new operator was appointed.
OL,9,FThere have been no fixtures at
OL,10,FChelmsford City Racecourse since March
OL,11,Fafter the track's previous tenant,
OL,12,FGreat Leighs Estates Limited (GLEL),
OL,13,Fcollapsed into administration with
OL,14,Fdebts of more than #22m.
OL,16,FBut the racecourse said it had agreed a
OL,17,F"multi-year lease" with Arena Racing
OL,18,FCompany (ARC) and had pencilled in a
OL,19,Ffixture for 2 November.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
